<title>BELGIUM: Belgian company investment rose 9.9 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Belgian company investment rose 9.9 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's National Statistics Institute (NSI) released the following data on corporate investment, calculated from VAT returns, for (June) -</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     June 1996  May	June 1995</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1985)  226.2	188.5     205.8</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	 9.9	  11.5</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Jan-June period    Jan-May period</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	 5.5		    5.4</p>
<p>NOTE - non-industrial investments rose 2.1 percent in the first six months, industrial investments rose 11.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
